flowchart TD
    Launch[Open game] --> Detect{Account detector}
    Detect -->|new| Start[Start zero-state route]
    Detect -->|existing| Settings[Tap settings]
    Settings --> Account[Tap account]
    Account --> Delete[Tap delete archive]
    Delete --> Confirm[Tap confirm]
    Confirm --> Success{Delete success?}
    Success -->|no| Block[Block]
    Success -->|yes| Restart[Tap restart]
    Restart --> LaunchAgain[Launch again]
    LaunchAgain --> Verify{New account?}
    Verify -->|yes| Start
    Verify -->|no| Block
